.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1120-
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1121-- `conformance/v1/schema-cases/index.json`;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1122-- valid/invalid cases for `agent-skill-v6`, `csk-skill-v6`, `build-receipt-v1`, `install-marker-v2`, and `conformance-claim-v2`, while retaining frozen claim-v1 cases;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1123-- a separate Go fixture with `build/go.mod`, `build/cmd/golden-tool`, a transitive embedded input, and a vendored-dependency variant, while leaving the existing script golden fixture and registry hashes intact;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1124-- expected context-file vectors proving that `build_roots` are excluded on real installs, cache hits, and dry-runs while `SKILL.md` and unrelated eligible assets remain visible;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1125-- a byte-level `curator-build-source-v1` vector covering the domain prefix, unsigned path ordering, uint64be lengths, empty/binary files, root `.csk-install.json`, no mode/timestamp input, invalid paths, links/special files, duplicate paths, and mutation during use;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1126-- a structural-collision vector proving that legacy `a || NUL || x || NUL || b || NUL || y` can describe one binary file or two records, while the new length-framed build-source digests differ;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1127-- expected CCJ-1 build-input bytes with `build_source`, cache key, exact stored receipt bytes, receipt SHA-256, marker, artifact SHA-256, and dry-run plan;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md:1128:- a byte-level `curator-go-toolchain-v1` vector covering unsorted entries, regular files, directories, internal links, mode/timestamp non-inputs, LF/CRLF normalization, duplicate paths, invalid Unicode, escaping links, and a selected executable outside `GOROOT`;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1129-- `conformance/v1/manifest.json` with `protocol_version: "1.0.0-rc.4"`, `conformance/README.md` with v1/v2 claim transition rules, and `schemas/v1/README.md` with both claim schemas;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1130-- `conformance/v1/vectors/manager-lifecycle.json` for provider/build order, no-mutation dry-run, build failure, cache race/corruption, two-project success, success-versus-rollback, deterministic lock/target ordering, interrupted global-journal recovery, currentness, repair, and locked GC;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1131-- `conformance/v1/vectors/build-drivers.json` for build-root/context rules, environment, all five direct argv forms, full dependency/directive validation, target, pre-cache build-source identity, cache-key, toolchain-digest, and receipt-byte semantics;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1132-- `tools/generate-vectors/main.go` (rc.4 current constant, frozen rc.3 claim-v1 constant, plus claim-v2 cases) and its tests for the new canonical bytes/hashes; `tools/validate.py` (rc.4 manifest assertion), `tools/release_gate.py`, and their tests/manifest inventory for new schemas, vectors, decision, claim transition, and release metadata;
.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1133-- release-facing `README.md`, `COMPATIBILITY.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and `RELEASE.md`.
