EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-1uv5gi_csk-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3j8pp5_go-toolchain-identity/README.md-7-Own src/csk/builds/toolchain.py and its focused tests. Capture the operator process search path before project shim augmentation, reject repository or project-managed Go candidates, resolve the real GOROOT bin/go executable, run only the three package-independent probe forms from an empty bootstrap environment, validate the accepted Go release-family allowlist and native tuning tuple, and fingerprint the complete GOROOT tree. Add no package or manager-config build-policy fields and run no go list or go build.
