EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-1uv5gi_csk-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3j8pp5_go-toolchain-identity/README.md-9-## Acceptance Criteria
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-1uv5gi_csk-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3j8pp5_go-toolchain-identity/README.md-10-The probe invokes direct argv for go telemetry off, go version, and the fixed go env -json field list, verifies GOTELEMETRY off and GOTELEMETRYDIR inside the operation-private root, and deletes that root on every exit. GOROOT, GOHOSTOS, GOHOSTARCH, GOOS, GOARCH, and exactly one applicable tuning variable are validated and frozen. The framed tree digest handles files, directories, internal relative links, normalized LF or CRLF version output, duplicate and invalid paths, escaping links, executable checks, and tree mutation exactly as shared vectors require. Pre-Go-1.23, unknown release families, wrappers, repository-local Go, and mismatched GOROOT fail closed. Focused pytest and strict mypy pass on POSIX and Windows-safe imports.
