.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-1207-| Go build flags and PGO | [Go command](https://go.dev/cmd/go/#hdr-Compile_packages_and_dependencies) | `-trimpath`, `-buildvcs`, `-buildmode`, `-compiler`, `-mod`, `-ldflags`, and `-o` are fixed; PGO otherwise defaults to package-local `default.pgo`, so v1 fixes `-pgo=off`. |
